   {% endif %}
{% else %}
3. E2E tests are off in this run: write no scenarios and leave `scenarios` empty
   (`e2e_note`: "E2E tests off").
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if inputs.e2e_tests != 'off' %}
Report every scenario in `scenarios` (feature file, name, its Given/When/Then lines, status
{% if inputs.e2e_tests == 'write_and_run' %}`passed` / `failed` = run here, with their screenshots{% else %}`pending` = written and parsed, run at release{% endif %}; `skipped` with the reason when it could not
be written, e.g. no E2E framework).{% if inputs.e2e_tests != 'write_and_run' %} Scenarios never make `tests_status` fail.{% endif %} Say in
